Hi {name}, welcome to Enshrine Virtual Office!

To sign in for the first time:
1. Open this link and choose your own password (it works once and expires in 3 days):
{url}

2. Then sign in at {login}
   Email: {email}
   Password: the one you just chose

If the link has expired, just let us know and we'll send a new one.
